      }
     ],
     "is": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "s": "Sigmundur tekur nú blóðrefilinn, og ristu nú í milli sín helluna og létta eigi fyrr en lokið er að rista, sem kveðið er:"
      }
     ],
     "en": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "s": "Then Þórr came to the river called Vimur, the greatest of all rivers. He buckled on his belt of strength and braced himself downstream with Gríðr's staff, and Loki held on beneath the belt of strength. And when Þórr came to the middle of the river, the river rose so much that it broke over his shoulders. Then Þórr spoke this:"
      }
     ],
